{
  "name": "Prospecting - 05 Vapi Call Results",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Vapi end-of-call-report webhook\n\nReceives Vapi server messages. Set your Vapi assistant's **Server URL** to this workflow's production webhook URL (shown on the `Vapi Webhook` node after activation) and set the server secret to the same value as the `VAPI_WEBHOOK_SECRET` env var.\n\nOn each completed call:\n1. Updates `outreach_log` (outcome, summary, transcript, cost)\n2. Updates the prospect's `outreach_status`\n3. `asked_not_to_call` -> sets `do_not_contact` + adds to `suppression_list`\n4. interested / voicemail -> follow-up email to the prospect\n5. interested / callback -> alert email to you\n\nRequires:\n- env vars `SUPABASE_URL`, `VAPI_WEBHOOK_SECRET`, `DIGEST_FROM_EMAIL`, `DIGEST_TO_EMAIL`\n- credentials: \"Supabase Service Role (Header Auth)\", \"SMTP Account\"",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "e5000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [60, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "vapi-call-results",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e5000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Vapi Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [140, 560],
      "webhookId": "e5000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "secret-ok",
              "leftValue": "={{ !!$env.VAPI_WEBHOOK_SECRET && $json.headers['x-vapi-secret'] === $env.VAPI_WEBHOOK_SECRET }}",
